### CLI

```console
$ appjail oci run \
    -o ephemeral \
    -o overwrite=force \
    -o virtualnet=":<random> default" \
    -o nat \
    ghcr.io/appjail-makejails/glances glances &&
  appjail stop glances
```

### Web-UI

```console
$ appjail oci run -Pd \
    -o overwrite=force \
    -o virtualnet=":<random> default" \
    -o nat \
    -o expose=61208 \
    ghcr.io/appjail-makejails/glances glances
```
